Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.48,0:00:03.31,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,A messenger from Tanbarun?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.77,0:00:05.75,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,He'll be here by morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.75,0:00:08.77,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,A lot happened when Shirayuki\N was invited, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.77,0:00:10.36,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,It's about that, apparently.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.79,0:00:14.70,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Was she able to get closer to that foolish prince?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.70,0:00:18.84,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,At the very least, she doesn't think of him as foolish.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.84,0:00:21.09,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,That is wonderful, I suppose.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.09,0:00:23.70,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Perhaps she simply gets along with princes?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.12,0:00:28.55,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you think that's the case, surely you'd also be \Nable to build a good relationship with her, Brother?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.55,0:00:33.01,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Indeed, but if I got closer to her, \Nwould you not feel uneasy?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.34,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Your concern is unnecessary.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.15,0:00:38.64,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Concern? I was just being mean.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.44,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,{\q2}In any case, it'll be quite entertaining if Tanbarun \Nstill wants something from Shirayuki, no?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.31,0:00:47.81,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I will handle the proper greeting of the messenger.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.81,0:00:48.82,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.44,0:02:31.00,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,This will do nicely.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.08,0:02:37.22,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Now I just need to weed the front
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.61,0:02:40.53,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,and check on the akimesou's budding...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.31,0:02:47.14,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,That hurt! You... Unhand me!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.86,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Oh, so it really {\i1}was{\i0} you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.86,0:02:51.23,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "it really {\i1}was{\i0} you"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.56,0:02:52.75,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Mihaya?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.75,0:02:53.90,GJM_Main,Miyaha,0,0,0,,That {\i1}is{\i0} my name, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.60,0:02:55.71,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,Gods...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.56,0:02:59.45,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,I came here as a messenger from Tanbarun!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.57,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,I finished greeting Prince Zen and the others,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.57,0:03:04.09,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,so I came by to say hello to you, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.09,0:03:08.09,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,If you wanted to meet with Missy, \Nwhy were you skulking about in the shadows?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.09,0:03:10.76,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,Because it was likely that {\i1}someone{\i0}\N I'd rather not meet would be with her,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.56,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,you wretched stray cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.56,0:03:13.79,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Messenger?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.67,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Mihaya, did you move to Tanbarun?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.82,0:03:20.84,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,When you were kidnapped by Sea Claw,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.84,0:03:24.68,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,I provided Tanbarun with vital information\N that lead to their capture, no?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.06,0:03:30.32,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,After that, apparently they managed to drag out \Na lot of other villains with connections to the Claw.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.32,0:03:32.19,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,As a reward, my status was improved.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.40,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,I don't quite have any power yet,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.19,0:03:40.86,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,but in theory, I am the head \Nof the Shisk viscount family.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.86,0:03:43.68,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Oh, you seem really capable.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.91,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,And then you became Tanbarun's messenger?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.42,0:03:51.05,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,No. I just wanted to come \Nbecause we're acquainted.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.05,0:03:52.25,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,The real messenger is someone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.72,0:03:54.71,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,And he has some business with you, Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.79,0:03:56.98,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,With me?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.05,0:04:01.15,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.07,0:04:03.83,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.83,0:04:06.89,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,Zen is inside. Prince Izana too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.89,0:04:08.64,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.23,0:04:11.23,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,But a messenger from Tanbarun...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.23,0:04:13.56,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Did something happen to Prince Raj?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.95,GJM_Main,Kiki,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem to be the case.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.95,0:04:17.57,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,Though I do see why you'd think that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.66,0:04:22.95,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,Shirayuki has just arrived!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.20,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.20,0:04:30.87,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Miss Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.81,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Sakaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.81,0:04:36.38,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,It seems he has something \Nhe wishes to give you, Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.53,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Prince Izana...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.34,0:04:44.76,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Zen and I are here because we thought\N there ought to be witnesses.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.13,0:04:51.87,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,We came here representing the prince of Tanbarun.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.69,0:04:55.02,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Miss Shirayuki, please accept this gift.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.05,0:04:59.34,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Prince Raj himself stated thus:
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.34,0:05:02.84,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,I am giving Miss Shirayuki from Clarines Kingdom
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.84,0:05:05.91,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,the title of "Friend of the \NRoyal Family" from Tanbarun.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.87,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Title...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.27,0:05:13.11,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,That red-haired girl you dared\N to lay your hands upon
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.08,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,is the sole person in all Tanbarun
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.29,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,to have earned the title\N "Friend of the Royal Family"!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.81,0:05:22.27,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,U-Um... But that...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.27,0:05:24.86,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Wasn't that just a bluff \Nrequired by the circumstances?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.86,0:05:28.23,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Though its origins are as you describe,\N Prince Raj proposed it
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.68,0:05:31.97,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,and the king approved of it, \Nsaying he thought it interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.33,0:05:35.85,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,With this, you are no less than a dignitary now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.39,0:05:41.38,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Prince Raj was so kind as to allow you to visit\N our country whenever you wish, Miss Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.31,0:05:50.72,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.93,0:05:57.14,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.21,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Zen...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.60,GJM_Main,Zen/Red,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's laughing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.26,0:06:09.08,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,B-Brother?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.08,0:06:10.34,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Prince Izana?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.34,0:06:12.18,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,"Friend of the Royal Family"!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.63,0:06:14.81,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,A little peculiar, but amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.76,0:06:19.40,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Oh, to be clear, I'm not laughing at you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.40,0:06:20.81,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,I simply found it rather humorous.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.34,0:06:32.73,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,I once told you that having \Na nobody like you by his side
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.73,0:06:34.99,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,would only tarnish Zen's name.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.52,0:06:41.21,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,But now we can mention \Nyour friendship without issue.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.60,0:06:53.01,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.01,0:06:56.91,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,What do you want to be like with Zen?{from the preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.91,0:06:59.56,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever asked you that.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.23,0:07:04.09,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,I don't know if there's \Nanything you can say, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.31,0:07:07.84,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your newly earned title.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.11,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.99,0:07:18.07,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.00,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.30,0:07:23.29,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I was just... surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.54,0:07:26.84,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.72,0:07:31.63,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,There's no rush to think about anything more.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.56,0:07:55.72,GJM_Main,Ryu,0,0,0,,You think that will do?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.72,0:07:56.68,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.79,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.41,0:08:01.61,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are, Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.61,0:08:03.03,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Please, go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.86,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Sakaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.86,0:08:08.96,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Apparently he wants to talk with you for a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.82,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Ryu, can you help me with something?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.82,0:08:12.53,GJM_Main,Ryu,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.00,0:08:17.55,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,I apologize for interrupting your work.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.55,0:08:21.35,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,It's fine. I just finished a task, \Nso it's a good time to take a break.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.65,0:08:25.93,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.93,0:08:30.48,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,I'm still thinking of making you Prince \NRaj's partner when a chance arises.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.43,0:08:34.45,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,I think it would be interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.00,0:08:38.57,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I don't think Prince Raj would want that, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.57,0:08:40.13,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,That's a different matter.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.13,0:08:42.89,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,If I'm persistent enough, he may give in.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.17,0:08:48.92,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Didn't Prince Raj discover something \Nhe wanted to do of his own will?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.92,0:08:49.88,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.38,0:08:54.11,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,At this hour, he's likely soundly asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.65,0:09:14.86,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,How long have you been by his side?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.28,0:09:19.87,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,I've been serving him since the time\N he was five and I was sixteen.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.87,0:09:21.84,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,That's quite some time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.60,0:09:25.35,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,I'm merely standing behind him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.35,0:09:29.71,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,But for that reason alone, \Nmy perspective has always mirrored his.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.04,0:09:34.14,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,And that is how I know that when you \Nwere with him, his life was truly shining.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.04,0:09:37.92,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,It was full of new things for him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.92,0:09:39.60,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.08,0:09:43.27,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,And that is the kind of prince \Nthat entrusted me with this.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.73,0:09:45.85,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,It's a private letter, apparently.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.59,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Addressed to his first true friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.31,0:09:57.53,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Shirayuki, how have you been\N after everything that has happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.17,0:10:01.56,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}As for me, I'm advancing through my hectic days.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.56,0:10:03.33,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sakaki, whom I sent to you,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.42,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}may say that he wants you by my side and so on,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.42,0:10:08.68,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}but you need not trouble yourself with such things.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.67,0:10:16.67,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do not believe our current\N relationship is problematic.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.40,0:10:20.72,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though I may overstep my bounds\N in what I am about to say...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.82,0:10:23.50,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is in regards to the title.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.50,0:10:26.98,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Shirayuki, you are deeply\N connected to us royals,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.98,0:10:29.17,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}so it may not seem like much.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.80,0:10:32.41,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}Regardless, I wished to send \Nyou a shield you can wield.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.07,0:10:36.07,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}You will not lose anything by wielding it, \Nso there is little reason not to.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.14,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am living by the same principle.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.94,0:10:41.57,GJM_Main,Raj,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sincerely, Raj Schenazade.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.05,0:10:55.20,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.26,0:11:07.87,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,It really is calming here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.75,0:11:22.03,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Missy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.51,0:11:25.93,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Obi! Why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.93,0:11:28.50,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,I am, you know, a nocturnal creature.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.01,0:11:31.47,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you{\i0} doing here, though?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.47,0:11:33.68,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,It's not even close to daybreak.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.68,0:11:35.79,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Ah... I woke up...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.16,0:11:38.26,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,And I was thinking of going to the herb harden...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.63,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Your expression is clearly\N saying something's wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.97,0:11:48.68,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,I heard you received a title from your home country,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.68,0:11:51.12,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,so I was sure you'd be overjoyed...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.43,0:11:55.37,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,It was a bit of a surprise, but I am happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.37,0:11:57.27,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,It seems Prince Raj is doing well, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.27,0:12:00.55,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,That so? Great, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.34,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Y-Yesterday...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.66,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Something happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.70,0:12:11.91,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I just thought that... I have no idea where I am now.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.71,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Where you are?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.71,0:12:16.45,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,I don't really get it,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.45,0:12:20.02,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,but are you saying that you \Nrealized where you want to be?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.45,0:12:22.93,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,No, I'm saying that I didn't know all this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.41,0:12:30.07,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,I think that before you start \Nthinking about complicated things,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.07,0:12:32.48,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,you should just meet up with Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.49,0:12:38.19,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zen might have been thinking\N about it the whole time.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.19,0:12:41.63,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}The place where Prince Zen can take you...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.63,0:12:44.36,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you, too, wish to go there with him...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.17,0:12:46.74,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,What lies ahead...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.86,0:12:51.31,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I... I never...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.33,0:12:55.76,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.88,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Obi, can I count on your help?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.94,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Didn't I say before that if \Nthere's a place you want to go,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.94,0:13:06.56,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,I'd take you there?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.56,0:13:07.01,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Obi...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.23,0:13:11.10,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Though I guess this time \NI'm bringing it to you instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.49,0:13:14.16,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,This is my duty.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.16,0:13:16.05,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Just sit tight, Missy.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.18,0:13:35.87,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Shirayuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.87,0:13:36.96,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Zen!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.13,0:13:45.55,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Shirayuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.41,0:13:55.84,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Zen... Yesterday I... I still couldn't \Nrespond to Prince Izana's words...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.53,0:13:58.07,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for staying quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.52,0:14:02.48,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I realized after that...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.01,0:14:06.78,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Ever since that day when I said I love you,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.78,0:14:09.73,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I've wanted to stay by your side and help you,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.73,0:14:13.44,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,and even now, nothing I've said has changed!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.41,0:14:16.56,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.33,0:14:23.34,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Zen!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.23,0:14:28.34,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I-Is it okay for me to think about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.89,0:14:33.14,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I love you, Zen, so I want to stay by your side.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.25,0:14:36.15,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I want to be able to stand by your side someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.53,0:14:45.17,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,After I told you not to rush...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.31,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Zen...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.73,0:15:14.08,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.61,0:15:16.64,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,The next few words should come from me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.71,0:15:18.71,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Shirayuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.21,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.57,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,My legs just gave out...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.57,0:15:27.45,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,It's okay. Sorry, it's because I...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.45,0:15:29.02,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Can you stand, Shirayuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.65,0:15:30.93,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.15,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Okay then!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.16,0:15:38.33,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.94,0:15:41.26,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,It's still too early to start \Nyour herbalist work, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.74,0:15:48.19,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,Wh-Why is Obi sleeping in Zen's room?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.87,0:15:52.93,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Mitsuhide.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.93,0:15:55.68,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,What's this? A clandestine nightly visit?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.68,0:15:58.35,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,I should be the one to ask you what you're doing!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.89,0:16:04.44,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I remember perfectly who is where\N at all times in this castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.44,0:16:05.39,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Leave this to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.39,0:16:07.46,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Okay. So you can sneak out?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.46,0:16:09.58,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,It's a habit from my childhood.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.58,0:16:10.34,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Don't think badly of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.34,0:16:13.66,GJM_Main,Guard,0,0,0,,But isn't it amazing? Such a great person!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.26,GJM_Main,Guard2,0,0,0,,Keep it down!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.26,0:16:17.36,GJM_Main,Guard2,0,0,0,,I have to say though, \Nwe're on night shift until dawn,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.86,GJM_Main,Guard2,0,0,0,,and you're still going on about it...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.86,0:16:21.62,GJM_Main,Guard,0,0,0,,But sir, she's a friend of the royal family now!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.62,0:16:23.58,GJM_Main,Guard,0,0,0,,That's our Miss Shirayuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.58,0:16:26.22,GJM_Main,Guard2,0,0,0,,You're going to regret saying\N this if Prince Zen hears you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.22,0:16:30.17,GJM_Main,Guard,0,0,0,,It's fine! Prince Zen is a very big-hearted person!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.11,GJM_Main,Kiki,0,0,0,,What are you two getting up to together?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.11,0:16:39.81,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,I received a report from the guards\N that they spotted Zen,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.81,0:16:42.86,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,but it's very early, so I went\N looking for him just in case...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.86,0:16:45.48,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Looks like he was meeting up with Missy.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.02,0:16:47.69,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,You knew about this.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.69,0:16:50.90,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Can't say I know what transpired, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.90,0:16:53.80,GJM_Main,Kiki,0,0,0,,They'll be back by breakfast.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.80,0:16:55.64,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.31,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,You're not going to talk to them?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.31,0:17:00.79,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,Sometimes our duty is to simply watch\N over him without saying anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.17,0:17:03.94,GJM_Main,Obi,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.05,0:17:27.10,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,The air is so clear.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.10,0:17:29.16,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,No one will bother us here.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.16,0:17:30.19,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,We're alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.74,0:17:34.20,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I-It's because you weren't able to stand!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.20,0:17:36.86,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I thought it would be troublesome\N if someone saw us like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.28,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Ah, I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.78,0:17:40.58,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.74,0:18:04.76,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.33,0:18:06.44,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.74,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I already told my brother...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.26,0:18:11.46,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,how I feel about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.07,0:18:14.58,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.58,0:18:16.93,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Well, it's not really because of that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.93,0:18:19.03,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,What you told me today...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.65,0:18:23.31,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I-Is it okay for me to think about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.31,0:18:27.54,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I love you, Zen, so I want to stay by your side.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.26,0:18:30.15,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I want to be able to stand by your side someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.23,0:18:35.59,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,My answer to those words is "yes".
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.67,0:18:42.55,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,It always has been.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.35,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,What I'm about to say is just me being selfish.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.33,0:18:52.87,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.87,0:18:56.53,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,One day, I'll say it properly.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.29,0:18:58.04,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.94,0:19:03.66,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Though I guess it's not really nice\N to promise to say something later.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.03,0:19:05.08,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.78,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Ever since I met you,\N you've always been a really nice person.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.52,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.77,0:19:38.82,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.93,0:19:43.99,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.99,0:19:47.04,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,, I'll be seeing off the Tanbarun messengers at 2 pm.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.57,0:19:48.43,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.29,0:19:56.49,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,That's all. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.19,0:20:05.73,GJM_Main,Izana,0,0,0,,That's the first time he looked \Ninto my eyes the whole time.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.77,0:20:17.01,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Prince Raj has become a most reliable friend, Sakaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.01,0:20:19.81,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,It's not enough. He still has a ways to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.81,0:20:21.15,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,That's harsh.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.46,0:20:23.95,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Well then, if you'll excuse us.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.17,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Sakaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.17,0:20:29.99,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.93,0:20:34.32,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Here is my reply to the letter.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.32,0:20:36.29,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Could you give it to Prince Raj?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.12,0:20:38.71,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.71,0:20:42.05,GJM_Main,Sakaki,0,0,0,,I'll try to persuade you the next time \NI have the chance, Miss Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.15,0:20:48.94,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,Make sure to be nice to me too, \NMiss Friend of the Royal Family.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.94,0:20:52.47,GJM_Main,Mihaya,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind adopting you into\N my family if you need a noble rank.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.47,0:20:53.02,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Ado—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.10,0:20:56.26,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,When he has the chance, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.26,0:20:57.82,GJM_Main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Seems like it could be soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.82,0:21:00.44,GJM_Main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Shirayuki's fate is connected \Nto many people after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.58,0:21:06.73,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,This is just a guess of mine, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.73,0:21:09.35,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Did he tell you to come to Raj's side?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.35,0:21:11.75,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I-It's exactly like you guessed...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.75,0:21:15.01,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,That wasn't nice of me, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.04,0:21:18.87,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Wait... it wasn't supposed to be funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.64,0:21:22.42,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.04,0:21:24.51,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,Let's get back to work!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.51,GJM_Main,Kiki/Mitsu,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.03,0:21:26.51,GJM_Overlap,Obi,0,0,0,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.15,0:23:08.17,GJM_Main,Mitsu,0,0,0,,In the evening we have a meeting \Nabout scheduling inspections.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.17,0:23:11.04,GJM_Main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Before that, you'll have to read through the reports.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.04,0:23:11.70,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.64,0:23:14.12,GJM_Main,Zen,0,0,0,,I'll see you later, Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.42,0:23:16.16,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,See you later, Zen.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.99,0:23:20.81,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,This is my own path.{ep 1}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:21.31,0:23:22.63,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,My own story.{ep 1}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.97,0:23:24.59,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Oh, Shirayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.89,0:23:26.64,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Did you see the messengers off?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.64,0:23:29.11,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,Yes. Are you headed to the medicine room?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.11,0:23:29.72,GJM_Main,Garak,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.72,0:23:34.94,GJM_Main,Ryu,0,0,0,,I was thinking about grinding montlet while\N it's still in the good condition I stored it in.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.41,0:23:36.89,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I'll go with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.89,0:23:37.64,GJM_Main,Ryu,0,0,0,,That'd be great.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.12,0:23:42.60,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,If I could make a wish,{ep 1}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.71,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I would want to control my own destiny.{ep 1}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.58,0:23:49.16,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,If I could make a wish,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.16,0:23:51.11,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,I would want this story to be painted...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.57,0:23:53.54,GJM_Main,Red,0,0,0,,in the color of fate.
